FINAL UPGRADE — CONTEXT COMPRESSION LAYER

Large repositories contain too many documentation files to load simultaneously.

To maintain reasoning quality implement context compression.

Entry-point must prioritize loading docs in this order:

1. code-map.md  
2. feature-boundaries.md  
3. relevant file-index docs  
4. relevant architecture docs  
5. debugging docs if needed  

Only load minimal required context.

This prevents token overload and improves reasoning accuracy.

